147
00:46:21,960 --> 00:46:23,840
So this is a long-running column.

148
00:46:23,840 --> 00:46:25,680
We're just explaining to other economists

149
00:46:25,680 --> 00:46:27,520
there's some facts that don't fit the theory.

150
00:46:27,520 --> 00:46:31,000
All right, does anyone have questions about that?

151
00:46:31,000 --> 00:46:33,000
OK.

