01:22:43,760 --> 01:22:47,040
I don't keep repeating that quote.

58
01:22:47,040 --> 01:22:50,240
Shows that altruism isn't necessary.

59
01:22:50,240 --> 01:22:53,400
It's sufficient but not necessary to produce the goods.

60
01:22:53,400 --> 01:22:55,520
I mean, but like Smith didn't say,

61
01:22:55,520 --> 01:22:58,000
benevolence is not necessary to bake the bread.

62
01:22:58,000 --> 01:23:01,160
He actually said benevolence doesn't bake the bread.

63
01:23:01,160 --> 01:23:03,960
It's self-interest that makes the bread.

64
01:23:03,960 --> 01:23:07,000
So, it tends to be people are selfish.

