01:57:29,040 --> 01:57:32,480
I mean, Buchanan had like 150 PhD students in his career.

487
01:57:32,480 --> 01:57:33,680
I think Tullock had one.

488
01:57:33,680 --> 01:57:37,960
Right, and it's a coincidence that Buchanan

